        "abstract": "Sierra Nevada Corporation's (SNC's) flagship Dream Chaser® spacecraft will use a Draper designed Fault Tolerant Flight Computer for its resupply missions to the International Space Station. This paper discusses the architecture of major hardware and software functional blocks along with hierarchical fault detection and redundancy management features. System validation architectural details are also discussed.",
